  "instruction": {
    "schemaVersion": 1,
    "text": "Please answer the questions below that ask you about your work perceptions and behaviour.\n\nPlease read each question carefully, and choose the response option that most accurately reflects how often the statement applies to you.\n\nPlease note: in this survey we use the term \"client\" to refer to the type of person you provide a service for in your work. In your particular line of work you may use a different term. For example, in retail the term might be \"customer\", in hospitality \"patron\", in education \"student\", in medical settings \"patient\", and so on. In this survey whenever you see the term \"client\" please simply think of your usual term.",
